ption\":\"\",\"styleId\":482110,\"doorsNumber\":\"2\",\"vin\":\"SCCLEJAX8THA10332\",\"MSRP\":123350,\"invoiceAmount\":0,\"blueBook\":0,\"sellingPrice\":121350,\"internetPrice\":0,\"originalPrice\":123350,\"miscPrice1\":0,\"miscPrice2\":0,\"miscPrice3\":0,\"NADARetailPrice\":0,\"mileage\":15,\"transmission\":\"Manual\",\"transmissionDescription\":\"\",\"transmissionSpeedNumber\":\"6\",\"engineCylindersNumber\":\"6\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"3.5\",\"engineDescription\":\"3.5L V-6 DOHC, variable valve control, intercooled supercharger, premium unleaded, engine with 400HP\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"Black w\\\/Red Accents\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"Simulated suede front seat upholstery\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Vivid Red\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"E32F43\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"101.4\",\"vehicleId\":145465517,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":259,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-01-14 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"\\\"Prestige Imports \\\/ Lotus Miami  is delighted to offer this 2026 Lotus Emira V6 SE for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Representing the purest expression of Lotus's \\\"\\\"For The Drivers\\\"\\\" philosophy, the Emira V6 SE combines mid-engine balance, communicative steering, and a thrilling supercharged V6 to create an exceptionally engaging modern sports car. Powered by a supercharged 3.5L V6 producing 400 horsepower and 310 lb-ft of torque, the Emira V6 SE sends power to the rear wheels through a six-speed manual transmission with a limited-slip differential, delivering a deeply rewarding connection between driver and machine. Its sculpted bodywork, low-slung stance, extended Black Pack, 20-inch forged alloy wheels, and striking red brake calipers give the Emira an unmistakable presence whether carving through winding roads, arriving at an exclusive automotive gathering, or enjoying a weekend drive. The V6 SE also benefits from refined damper calibration, optimized wheel alignment, and revised manual gearbox mounting, enhancing both ride comfort and the precision of every shift. Inside, the driver-focused cabin features Alcantara appointments, sport pedals, premium technology, and an intimate two-seat layout that keeps the emphasis exactly where it belongs, behind the wheel. With its hydraulic steering, rear-wheel drive, naturally balanced mid-engine chassis, and manual transmission, the Emira V6 SE offers the kind of analog driving experience that is increasingly rare in the modern sports-car world. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Lotus Emira V6 SE yours today. All pricing and details provided are believed to be accurate, but we do not warrant or guarantee such accuracy. The prices shown above may vary from region to region, as will incentives, and are subject to change. New vehicles offered may be eligible for manufacturer incentives which may change at any time and are subject to incentive qualification criteria and requirements, and which may be contingent upon manufacturer finance company approval. Manufacturer incentive data and vehicle features information is provided by third parties and believed to be accurate as of the time of publication. Vehicle information is based upon standard equipment and may vary from vehicle to vehicle. Please contact the dealership.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Coupe\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Coupe\",\"epaHighway\":24,\"epaCity\":16,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/new-2026-lotus-emira-v6-