xteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147511287,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":51,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-08-10 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"Prestige Imports is delighted to offer this 2024 Mercedes-Benz G-Class AMG G 63 for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Combining the legendary presence and capability of the G-Class with the extraordinary performance of Mercedes-AMG, the G 63 delivers an unmistakable blend of luxury, power, and off-road prowess. Powered by a handcrafted 4.0L twin-turbocharged V8 producing 577 horsepower and 627 lb-ft of torque, the G 63 sends power through an AMG SPEEDSHIFT TCT 9-speed automatic transmission and sophisticated four-wheel-drive system, accelerating from 0&ndash;60 mph in approximately 4.5 seconds. Its iconic boxy silhouette, AMG-specific grille, flared fenders, distinctive side-exit exhaust outlets, and commanding road presence ensure it stands out whether cruising through the city, arriving at an exclusive destination, or venturing off the beaten path. Inside, the cabin surrounds occupants with premium materials, luxurious leather, advanced technology, and AMG-specific performance details, creating an environment that blends first-class comfort with a distinctly driver-focused character. Beneath its unmistakable exterior, the G 63 retains serious off-road capability with low-range gearing and three locking differentials, allowing its immense power and advanced chassis technology to be enjoyed well beyond the pavement. For enthusiasts seeking an SUV that delivers iconic design, handcrafted luxury, exhilarating V8 performance, and legendary capability, the 2024 Mercedes-AMG G 63 is an exceptional choice. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Mercedes-Benz AMG G 63 yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":16,\"epaCity\":13,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-mercedes-benz-g-class-amg-g-63-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66001212\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2024-Mercedes-Benz-G-Class-AMG-G-63-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-W1NYC7HJ1RX508278\\\/sz_124590\\\/1dcc59ec0a0fe335d203a26ed6842ff6.jpg\",\"photoCount\":54,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Automatic Emergency Braking,Backup Camera,Blind Spot Monitor,Brake Assist,Convertible,Heated Seats,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Lane Departure Warning,Memory Seat,Navigation System,Parking Assist,Premium Sound System,Stability Control,Sunroof\\\/Moonroof,Tow Hooks,Traction Control,Trailer Hitch,Turbocharged,WIFI Hotspot\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own_fair.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/a3Tz0_CDlTE8NZPT275IYotxQ7H_ULmdtm1HUrltc4kB4P95RZDmDS-JbvJ2Bn3xXcOPxl2GRRxi_M2aJOZvMYYlqTM_nYvnYJY\",\"isOneOwner\":true},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Gray\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"All-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"4.0\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"8 Cylinder\",\"s