icleId\":147768101,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":15,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-15 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"\\\"**2026 Mercedes-Benz G-Class G63 AMG &ndash; MANUFAKTUR Edition**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is proud to present this extraordinary 2026 Mercedes-Benz G63 AMG, a stunning example of automotive excellence with only 4,201 miles. This CARFAX and AUTOCHECK Clean One Owner vehicle represents the pinnacle of luxury SUV performance, finished in the exclusive MANUFAKTUR Signature China Blue &ndash; a rare and captivating color that commands attention wherever it goes.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Uncompromising Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this beast lies a handcrafted 4.0L AMG V8 biturbo engine enhanced with a 48V mild hybrid system, delivering earth-shattering power through the AMG SPEEDSHIFT TCT 9-speed transmission. Full-time all-wheel drive with driver-selectable front and rear locking differentials ensures unstoppable capability, while the adaptive sport-tuned suspension provides both comfort and precision handling.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**MANUFAKTUR Luxury**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This G63 showcases the exclusive MANUFAKTUR Interior Package, featuring Black with Platinum White leather trim creating a striking two-tone cabin. The interior is appointed with Natural Grain Walnut Wood trim and includes the Seat Comfort Package with heated and cooled front seats, offering 12-way power adjustment with memory function. Modern convenience meets timeless luxury with Apple CarPlay and Android Auto integration through the NTG 7 MBUX multimedia system with a 12.3\\\"\\\" display and Burmester 3D Surround Sound.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Distinctive Styling**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Riding on stunning 22\\\"\\\" AMG polished forged monoblock wheels, this G63 makes an unforgettable statement. The iconic boxy silhouette is enhanced by LED adaptive headlamps, running boards, and chrome accents throughout.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Advanced Technology & Safety**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Equipped with Active Distance Assist DISTRONIC, Active Lane Keeping Assist, Blind Spot Assist, 360-degree camera system, and Active Brake Assist. The panoramic sunroof, heated steering wheel, and dual-zone climate control ensure every journey is exceptional.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #86231X \\\/ VIN: W1NWH5AB8TX087117**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Experience automotive perfection at Prestige Imports. This rare MANUFAKTUR G63 won't last long. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":16,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2026-mercedes-benz-g-class-amg-g-63-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66170895\",\"mainImageUrl\":null,\"photoCount\":0,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Automatic Emergency Braking,Backup Camera,Blind Spot Monitor,Brake Assist,Convertible,Heated Seats,Heated Steering Wheel,Hybrid,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Lane Departure Warning,Memory Seat,Navigation System,Parking Assist,Premium Sound System,Stability Control,Sunroof\\\/Moonroof,Tow Hooks,Traction Control,Trailer Hitch,Turbocharged,WIFI Hotspot\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own_fair.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehic