e and commands attention. The sophisticated two-tone Macchiato Beige and Black MB-Tex interior creates an inviting cabin atmosphere, complemented by Natural Grain Grey Oak trim that adds warmth and refinement to every journey.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Comfort and Convenience Redefined**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Experience ultimate comfort with heated and ventilated power front seats featuring driver and passenger memory settings, ensuring your perfect driving position every time. The panoramic power tilt\\\/sliding sunroof floods the cabin with natural light, while the Macchiato headliner adds a designer touch overhead. Illuminated running boards provide elegant entry and exit, while the Premium Package delivers enhanced luxury features throughout.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Technology at Your Fingertips**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Stay connected with the advanced 12.3\\\"\\\" MBUX touchscreen media display featuring Apple CarPlay and Android Auto integration. The system includes Mercedes-Benz navigation with live traffic updates, wireless charging, and SiriusXM radio. Multiple USB ports keep all passengers connected, while the mobile hotspot ensures you're always online.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Versatile Capability**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The factory-installed trailer hitch expands your adventure possibilities, while the efficient 2.0L turbocharged 4-cylinder engine paired with the smooth 9G-TRONIC 9-speed automatic transmission delivers impressive performance and fuel economy. Advanced safety features, including Active Brake Assist, Blind Spot Assist, and Active Parking Assist, provide confidence on every drive.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Premium Protection**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Thoughtful details like wheel-locking bolts, all-season floor mats, and load sill protection help preserve this GLE's pristine condition.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #85969Y \\\/ VIN: 4JGFB4JB1NA718018**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Visit Prestige Imports today and discover why this exceptional Mercedes-Benz GLE represents the perfect blend of luxury, technology, and versatility. All pricing and details provided are believed to be accurate, but we do not warrant or guarantee such accuracy. The prices shown above may vary from region to region, as will incentives, and are subject to change. New vehicles offered may be eligible for manufacturer incentives which may change at any time and are subject to incentive qualification criteria and requirements, and which may be contingent upon manufacturer finance company approval. Manufacturer incentive data and vehicle features information is provided by third parties and believed to be accurate as of the time of publication. Vehicle information is based upon standard equipment and may vary from vehicle to vehicle. Please contact the dealership.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Sport Utility\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Sport Utility\",\"epaHighway\":27,\"epaCity\":19,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2022-mercedes-benz-gle-350-north-miami-beach-fl-id-64609460\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2022-Mercedes-Benz-Gle-350-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-4JGFB4JB1NA718018\\\/sz_49514\\\/06fdaa96b001325df16d9cd68110939c.jpg\",\"photoCount\":54,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Automatic Emergency Braking,Backup Camera,Blind Spot Monitor,Brake Assist,Cooled Driver Seat,Cooled Passenger Seat,Dual Climate Control,Heated Seats,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Memory Seat,Navigation System,Parking Assist,Power Driver Seat,Premium Sound System,Rain Sensing Front Wipers,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Sunroof\\\/Moonroof,Traction Control,Trailer Hitch,Turbocharged,USB Port,WIFI Hotspot\",\"comment2\":\"DP1,P47,810,U80,550,55