ercedes-Benz GLE450 4MATIC Coupe &ndash; Where Luxury Meets Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Discover automotive excellence with this stunning 2025 Mercedes-Benz GLE450 4MATIC Coupe, finished in the exclusive MANUFAKTUR Signature Cote d'Azur Light Blue Metallic &ndash; a breathtaking hue that commands attention wherever you go. With only 7,327 miles, this like-new SUV coupe delivers the perfect blend of sophisticated style and cutting-edge technology.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Power Meets Efficiency**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Under the hood lies a potent 3.0L inline-6 turbo engine enhanced by a 48V mild hybrid system, delivering exhilarating performance while maximizing fuel efficiency. The 9G-TRONIC 9-speed automatic transmission with driver-selectable modes ensures seamless power delivery, while the 4MATIC all-wheel-drive system provides confident handling in any condition.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Exceptional Pedigree**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Rest assured with CARFAX Clean One Owner and AUTOCHECK Clean reports &ndash; this GLE450 has been meticulously maintained and is ready for its next discerning owner.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Premium Features & Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover power front seats with 4-way lumbar support and memory function, complemented by heated front seats for ultimate comfort. The brushed aluminum with longitudinal grain trim adds sophisticated elegance throughout the cabin, while the striking black headliner creates a dramatic ambiance. Enjoy seamless connectivity with the 12.3\\\"\\\" MBUX touchscreen featuring Apple CarPlay and Android Auto integration, plus wireless charging capability.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Advanced Safety & Convenience**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The comprehensive Driver Assistance Package includes Active Brake Assist, Blind Spot Assist, and a 360-degree camera system. Illuminated running boards provide elegant entry, while soft-close doors add that signature Mercedes-Benz refinement. The Winter Package ensures year-round capability, and the trailer hitch expands your adventure possibilities.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Distinctive Styling**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The Exclusive Trim package, rear spoiler, and 20\\\"\\\" AMG twin 5-spoke wheels create an aggressive yet refined stance. The panoramic sunroof floods the cabin with natural light, while the power liftgate offers convenient cargo access.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #86101Z \\\/ VIN: 4JGFD5KBXSB306006**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Experience the pinnacle of luxury SUV coupes at Prestige Imports. This rare MANUFAKTUR edition won't last long! Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":25,\"epaCity\":19,\"drivetrain\":\"All Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2025-mercedes-benz-gle-gle-450-4matic-coupe-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66299378\",\"mainImageUrl\":null,\"photoCount\":0,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Automatic Emergency Braking,Backup Camera,Blind Spot Monitor,Brake Assist,Convertible,Heated Seats,Hybrid,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Memory Seat,Navigation System,Parking Assist,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Sunroof\\\/Moonroof,Traction Control,Trailer Hitch,Turbocharged,USB Port\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/U83m0EXodHcvt1OL5zbLx