**Stock #ATF76042 \\\/ VIN: ZA9U11UC7RSF76042**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is honored to present one of the world's most exclusive and breathtaking hypercars &ndash; the 2024 Pagani Utopia Coupe. With only 3,832 carefully driven miles, this extraordinary machine represents the pinnacle of Italian craftsmanship, engineering excellence, and automotive passion.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**EXTERIOR ELEGANCE**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Finished in a stunning Yellow exterior, this Utopia commands attention wherever it travels. The vibrant hue accentuates every sculpted curve and aerodynamic element of Horacio Pagani's visionary design. Each body panel is a work of art, meticulously crafted from aerospace-grade materials that blend form and function in perfect harmony. The exposed carbon fiber elements, signature quad exhaust system, and distinctive Pagani styling cues create an unmistakable presence that stops traffic and stirs souls.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**INTERIOR OPULENCE**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover a Brown leather interior that exemplifies the marriage of luxury and motorsport heritage. Every surface showcases the finest materials and uncompromising attention to detail. The cabin features exquisite leather seats that envelope occupants in supreme comfort while providing exceptional support during spirited driving. Hand-stitched leather, machined aluminum components, and bespoke touches throughout create an ambiance that rivals the finest luxury automobiles ever created.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**PERFORMANCE PEDIGREE**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Powered by a gasoline-fed engine that delivers symphony and fury in equal measure, the Utopia represents Pagani's commitment to the pure, analog driving experience. This is a hypercar designed for those who appreciate the connection between man and machine, where every input is rewarded with immediate, visceral feedback.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**EXCLUSIVITY DEFINED**<br\\\/><br\\\/>With extremely limited production numbers worldwide, the Pagani Utopia represents an investment in automotive history. This is not merely transportation &ndash; it's a rolling sculpture, a technological marvel, and a testament to what's possible when passion meets perfection.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**PRESTIGE IMPORTS DIFFERENCE**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At Prestige Imports, we understand that acquiring a vehicle of this caliber requires exceptional service and expertise. Our team is dedicated to providing a seamless ownership experience worthy of this magnificent automobile.<br\\\/><br\\\/>Don't miss this rare opportunity to own one of the most coveted hypercars ever created. Contact Prestige Imports today to schedule your private viewing of this remarkable 2024 Pagani Utopia Coupe. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":null,\"epaCity\":null,\"drivetrain\":\"\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-pagani-utopia-cpe-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65767973\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2024-Pagani-Utopia-Cpe-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-ZA9U11UC7RSF76042\\\/sz_1\\\/41b5efca3b871c4c8bd59cf0bd659ff1.jpg\",\"photoCount\":60,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Lane Departure Warning,Leather Seats\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":null,\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Yellow\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"stan