ophisticated and rare Cream White exterior over a luxurious Black leather interior. With just 32,929 miles on the odometer, this iconic sports car represents an exceptional opportunity to own a modern classic that delivers the legendary 911 driving experience.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Performance & Engineering Excellence**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this Carrera lies a naturally aspirated 3.4-liter flat-six engine, producing exhilarating power through the advanced 7-speed Porsche Doppelkupplung (PDK) automatic transmission. This lightning-fast dual-clutch gearbox delivers seamless shifts and optimal performance, whether you're carving through canyon roads or cruising the highway. The rear-wheel-drive configuration maintains the pure 911 driving dynamics that enthusiasts crave.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Exceptional Comfort & Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Step inside to discover 18-way adaptive sport power bucket seats with heated and ventilated functions, ensuring optimal comfort in any climate. The multi-stage heating controls and front seat ventilation make every journey pleasurable, regardless of weather conditions. The SportDesign PDK steering wheel features integrated shift paddles and audio controls, putting complete command at your fingertips.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Premium Features & Appointments**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This Carrera is exceptionally equipped with stunning 20-inch Carrera S aluminum wheels (8.5\\\"\\\" front\\\/11\\\"\\\" rear) painted in Platinum, elevating its aggressive stance. Bi-Xenon headlights with Porsche Dynamic Light System (PDLS) illuminate the road ahead with precision, while auto-dimming interior and exterior mirrors enhance safety and convenience. Entertainment comes via SiriusXM Satellite Radio with HD Radio capability.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Distinctive Details**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Power Steering Plus ensures effortless maneuverability, while wheel caps with colored Porsche crests add authentic finishing touches. The comprehensive Porsche Stability Management system provides confidence-inspiring control in all driving conditions.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #86014T \\\/ VIN: WP0CA2A98DS140925**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This 911 Carrera represents an outstanding value in the iconic sports car segment. Visit Prestige Imports today to experience the timeless appeal and thrilling performance that only a Porsche 911 can deliver. All pricing and details provided are believed to be accurate, but we do not warrant or guarantee such accuracy. The prices shown above may vary from region to region, as will incentives, and are subject to change. New vehicles offered may be eligible for manufacturer incentives which may change at any time and are subject to incentive qualification criteria and requirements, and which may be contingent upon manufacturer finance company approval. Manufacturer incentive data and vehicle features information is provided by third parties and believed to be accurate as of the time of publication. Vehicle information is based upon standard equipment and may vary from vehicle to vehicle. Please contact the dealership.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Convertible\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Convertible\",\"epaHighway\":27,\"epaCity\":19,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2013-porsche-911-carrera-cabriolet-north-miami-beach-fl-id-64609338\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2013-Porsche-911-Carrera-Cabriolet-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0CA2A98DS140925\\\/sz_39985\\\/fc9a46a9b8c6300a5ab5500c317a8cb5.jpg\",\"photoCount\":48,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Automatic Emergency Braking,Brake Assist,Convertible,Cooled Driver Seat,Cooled Passenger Seat,Dual Climate Contr