stige Imports is delighted to offer this 2024 Porsche 911 Carrera S Coupe for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Blending everyday comfort with thrilling sports car performance, the Carrera S continues Porsche's tradition of delivering one of the most rewarding driving experiences on the road. Powered by a twin-turbocharged 3.0L flat-six engine producing 443 horsepower and 390 lb-ft of torque, this iconic coupe accelerates from 0&ndash;60 mph in as little as 3.3 seconds while offering exceptional balance, precision, and driver confidence. Its unmistakable silhouette, sculpted bodywork, and wide rear stance create a commanding presence whether carving through winding roads, attending a weekend cars and coffee event, or cruising the coastline. Inside, the meticulously crafted cabin surrounds the driver with premium materials, advanced technology, and a cockpit designed to keep the focus on the road ahead. Ideal for enthusiasts seeking a sports car that excels in both spirited driving and daily usability, the Carrera S Coupe delivers a perfect combination of performance, luxury, and timeless design. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this 911 Carrera S Coupe yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":null,\"epaCity\":null,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-porsche-911-carrera-s-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65383559\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2024-Porsche-911-Carrera-S-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AB2A99RS221542\\\/sz_102072\\\/b0cd499072bed03c7dd6b9d978bf17