r\":1998,\"isNew\":false,\"finalPrice\":221697,\"make\":\"Porsche\",\"model\":\"911\",\"modelNumber\":\"\",\"modelCode\":4554,\"trim\":\"Carrera S\",\"styleDescription\":\"\",\"styleId\":105665,\"doorsNumber\":\"2\",\"vin\":\"WP0AA2990WS321161\",\"MSRP\":0,\"invoiceAmount\":0,\"blueBook\":0,\"sellingPrice\":219950,\"internetPrice\":0,\"originalPrice\":219950,\"miscPrice1\":0,\"miscPrice2\":0,\"miscPrice3\":0,\"NADARetailPrice\":0,\"mileage\":28968,\"transmission\":\"automatic\",\"transmissionDescription\":\"\",\"transmissionSpeedNumber\":\"\",\"engineCylindersNumber\":\"6\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"3.6\",\"engineDescription\":\"\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"Black\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"252627\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Guards Red\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"E32F43\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147014069,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":70,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-07-22 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"\\\"**1998 Porsche 911 Carrera S &ndash; A Timeless Icon in Guards Red**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prestige Imports is proud to present this exceptional 1998 Porsche 911 Carrera S, a stunning example of automotive excellence that embodies the legendary 993-generation's final evolution. Finished in the iconic Guards Red over a sophisticated Black interior, this Carrera represents the perfect blend of classic Porsche styling and refined performance.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**EXCEPTIONAL LOW MILEAGE**<br\\\/>With just 28,968 carefully driven miles, this 911 Carrera S has been meticulously preserved and presents an outstanding opportunity to own a modern classic with plenty of life ahead. Both CARFAX and AUTOCHECK reports confirm clean histories, providing complete peace of mind.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**LEGENDARY PERFORMANCE**<br\\\/>At the heart of this Carrera S lies the legendary 3.6-liter air-cooled flat-six engine, featuring sophisticated Varioram intake technology that delivers exhilarating power across the rev range. The Digital Motor Electronics with dual knock-sensor system and fully integrated electronic twin-plug ignition ensure optimal performance and reliability. Power is delivered through an automatic transmission, making this 911 both thrilling and accessible for daily enjoyment.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**ADVANCED ENGINEERING**<br\\\/>This Carrera S showcases Porsche's engineering prowess with computer-controlled full-time all-wheel drive featuring a viscous center clutch for exceptional traction and handling. The independent MacPherson strut front suspension and multi-link rear suspension with self-stabilizing toe characteristics provide the legendary Porsche balance and precision. Power-assisted four-wheel ventilated disc brakes with four-piston fixed alloy calipers and ABS deliver confident stopping power.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**DISTINCTIVE STYLING**<br\\\/>Rolling on stunning 18-inch Turbo-design pressure-cast alloy wheels (8.0\\\"\\\" front, 10.0\\\"\\\" rear), this 911 commands attention from every angle. The speed-dependent extendable rear spoiler, polyellipsoid headlights, and integrated fog lights combine form and function beautifully.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**COMFORT & CONVENIENCE**<br\\\/>Inside, you'll find leatherette reclining bucket seats with electric height adjustment, a leather-wrapped steering wheel, automatic climate control, power windows, cruise control, and an AM\\\/FM stereo system. The electric sliding sunroof adds open-air enjoyment to your driving experience.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**STOCK #CJ2606 \\\/ VIN: WP0AA2990WS321161**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This Guards Red beauty represents an increasingly rare opportunity to own an air-cooled Porsche 911 with remarkably low mileage. Visit Prestige Imports today and experience automotive history. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":25,\"epaCity\":17,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-1998-porsche-911-carrera-s-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65660242\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/1998-Porsche-911-Carrera-S-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AA2990WS321161\\\/sz_107263\\\/b01a109e388a58547b06c7ba71fa5097.jpg\",\"photoCount\":46,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Limited Slip Center Differential,Rear Spoiler,Sunroof\\\/Moonroof,Turbocharged\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/showme.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/qsQfZNefovvAsAwCndIuf7QeVPg7FkxzpQYfVDUKL00RwSUK3GQygyypk0bv09zbHvNupre1sraPFRygcuT-c_BFjGspeJrUrMI\",\"isOneOwner\":false},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Red\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"Rear-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"3.6\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"6 Cylinder\",\"standardizedTransmission\":\"Automatic\",\"standardizedFuelType\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedInteriorColor\":\"Black\",\"standardizedInteriorUpholstery\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"upperLev