\/><br\\\/>Created with an uncompromising focus on performance, the GT2 RS is powered by a 3.8L twin-turbocharged flat-six producing an incredible 700 horsepower and 553 lb-ft of torque, launching from 0&ndash;60 mph in just 2.7 seconds and reaching a top track speed of 211 mph. With rear-wheel drive, a race-bred chassis, rear-axle steering, and an aggressive aerodynamic package dominated by its massive rear wing, the GT2 RS delivers the kind of visceral performance normally reserved for dedicated track cars. Its low, wide stance, large air intakes, lightweight construction, center-lock wheels, and unmistakable GT2 RS design make it an instant standout among modern Porsche performance cars. Inside, the driver-focused cabin combines premium materials with performance-oriented details, creating an environment that feels just as purposeful as the exterior. For the enthusiast who wants a road-legal Porsche with extraordinary straight-line speed and serious track capability, the 2018 911 GT2 RS represents the ultimate expression of the 991-generation 911. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Porsche 911 GT2 RS yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":21,\"epaCity\":15,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2018-porsche-911-gt2-rs-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65864628\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2018-Porsche-911-GT2-RS-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AE2A94JS185092\\\/sz_113357\\\/a73c424dfd4154430646929fb8788d79.jpg\",\"photoCount\":57,\"series\":\"\",\"