 911 GT3 delivers an unforgettable blend of naturally aspirated power, precision engineering, and motorsport heritage. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this 911 GT3 yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Coupe\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Coupe\",\"epaHighway\":18,\"epaCity\":15,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2023-porsche-911-gt3-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65318084\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2023-Porsche-911-GT3-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AC2A95PS270540\\\/sz_108905\\\/d4b1ec3e7f6e793eac410e6eda67410c.jpg\",\"photoCount\":47,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Automatic Emergency Braking,Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Dual Climate Control,Heated Seats,HID Headlights,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Power Driver Seat,Premium Sound System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,USB Port,WIFI Hotspot\",\"comment2\":\"STDEN\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/good.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/SAV_3RRGqNTYj2iKUOmI3CUh_JzzPdtIRRm-yywY6d3Cs30f8NH9plzFLjch78w0oH9fx5T7S6TJ91nJxlVEHAxSN5kwdbDEZZs\",\"isOneOwner\":false},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl