s racing heritage for decades. With only **928 miles** on the odometer, this GT3 RS represents an extraordinary opportunity to own the most extreme naturally aspirated 911 ever created, with barely broken-in performance.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #10872B \\\/ VIN: WP0AC2A9XTS288493 \\\/ AUTOCHECK Clean**<br\\\/><br\\\/>**PERFORMANCE ENGINEERING AT ITS FINEST**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this beast lies a **4.0-liter naturally aspirated flat-six engine** that screams to redline with the kind of mechanical symphony only Porsche can orchestrate. Power is delivered through the lightning-fast **7-speed PDK dual-clutch transmission** with steering-wheel-mounted paddle shifters, offering millisecond gear changes that keep you in the power band whether attacking corners or accelerating down straights.<br\\\/><br\\\/>The GT3 RS sits on aggressive **20-inch front and 21-inch rear wheels** wrapped in performance-oriented **255\\\/35ZR20 front and 315\\\/30ZR21 rear tires**, providing maximum grip. The rear-wheel-drive configuration, combined with an electro-mechanical limited-slip differential and sport-tuned adaptive suspension, delivers the pure, unfiltered driving experience enthusiasts crave.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**TRACK-READY FEATURES**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This GT3 RS comes equipped with **4-way Sport Seats Plus with heating**, providing both support during spirited driving and comfort on the road. The interior showcases premium Race-Tex simulated suede throughout, including the steering wheel, headliner, and door trim inserts, creating an authentic motorsport atmosphere.<br\\\/><br\\\/>The **Porsche Communication Management (PCM) system** includes navigation, wireless smartphone charging, voice control, and Porsche Connect, with 10 years of service included. The Sound Package Plus delivers exceptional audio quality through 8 speakers with integrated amplification.<br\\\/><br\\\/>Advanced safety features include collision mitigation, backup camera, Porsche Stability Management, and comprehensive airbag protection.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**THE PRESTIGE IMPORTS DIFFERENCE**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This GT3 RS represents automotive excellence in its purest form &ndash; a limited-production masterpiece that combines track capability with everyday usability. Don't miss this rare opportunity to own a virtually new example of Porsche's flagship track weapon.<br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports today to schedule your private viewing of this exceptional 2026 Porsche 911 GT3 RS. All pricing and details provided are believed to be accurate, but we do not warrant or guarantee such accuracy. The prices shown above may vary from region to region, as will incentives, and are subject to change. New vehicles offered may be eligible for manufacturer incentives which may change at any time and are subject to incentive qualification criteria and requirements, and which may be contingent upon manufacturer finance company approval. Manufacturer incentive data and vehicle features information is provided by third parties and believed to be accurate as of the time of publication. Vehicle information is based upon standard equipment and may vary from vehicle to vehicle. Please contact the dealership.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Coupe\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Coupe\",\"epaHighway\":null,\"epaCity\":null,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2026-porsche-911-gt3-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65152910\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2026-Porsche-911-GT3-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AC2A9XTS288493\\\/sz_111948\\\/6ba31bcc51a7f5b890cc6d6b4187fb9b.jpg\",\"photoCount\":60,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Automatic Emergency Braking,Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Dual Climate Control,Heated Seats,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Power Driver Seat,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,USB Port,WIFI Hotspot\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own_good.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/rdgWpTncrDo0vTqUSyF3kfo7N2--wPCpfjPsXxQZGzCr1ednz12VLVOUClnM8lKGMak9iLBoWiPkFZsWl9sC5IQHS5pj2QN7RaQ\",\"isOneOwner\":true},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Red\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Coupe\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"Rear-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"4.0\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"6 Cylinder\",\"standardizedTransmission\":\"Automatic\",\"standardizedFuelType\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedInteriorColor\":\"Black\",\"standardizedInteriorUpholstery\":\"Suede\",\"upperLevelPackageCode\":null,\"packagesAndAccessories\":[],\"certificationProgram\":\"\",\"title\":\"2026 Porsche 911 GT3\",\"status\":\"in stock\",\"rebateAmount\":0,\"isReserved\":0,\"isCourtesy\":0,\"statusCode\":null,\"disclaimers\":[],\"isPooled\":0,\"cpo_validated\":null,\"vdp\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.lamborghinimiami.com\\\/vehicle-details\\\/used-2026-porsche-911-gt3-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65152910\",\"srp\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.lamborghinimiami.com\\\/used-2026-porsche-911-miami-fl\"}); });<\/script>\n<script>window.inlineJS.push(function() { Moff.modules.get('DataLayer').pushData('VehicleObject_65660241', {\"vuid\":65660241,\"stockNumber\":\"86182X\",\"year\":2023,\"isNew\":false,\"finalPrice\":651697,\"make\":\"Porsche\",\"model\":\"911\",\"modelNumber\":\"\",\"modelCode\":36966,