ls of aerodynamic grip and precision. Its active aerodynamics, carbon fiber bodywork, and motorsport-derived engineering create an unforgettable driving experience whether attacking a road course or taking pride of place in a world-class collection. For enthusiasts and collectors alike, the Tribute to Carrera RS Package represents far more than a special edition, it is a celebration of Porsche's racing heritage and one of the most desirable 992-generation GT3 RS models ever offered. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Porsche 911 GT3 RS yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\\\"\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":18,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2023-porsche-911-gt3-rs-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65660241\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2023-Porsche-911-GT3-RS-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AF2A98PS278459\\\/sz_110336\\\/e3b628726753bc3766ea400fae74ed94.jpg\",\"photoCount\":53,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own.svg\",\"link\":\"h