lockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"Black w\\\/GT Silver Stitch\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"White\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"F2F6F9\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147815199,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":12,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-09-18 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"**Prestige Imports Presents: 2023 Porsche 911 GT3 RS - A Track-Bred Masterpiece**<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #AT278099 \\\/ VIN: WP0AF2A94PS278099**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Prepare to experience automotive excellence in its purest form. This virtually new 2023 Porsche 911 GT3 RS arrives at Prestige Imports with a mere 512 miles, presenting an extraordinary opportunity to own one of the most coveted sports cars ever created.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Uncompromising Performance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At the heart of this beast lies a naturally aspirated 4.0-liter flat-six boxer engine, delivering spine-tingling performance through a lightning-fast 7-speed Porsche Doppelkupplung (PDK) transmission with steering wheel-mounted sequential shifters. The rear-wheel-drive configuration, paired with an electro-mechanical limited-slip differential and Porsche Stability Management, ensures every ounce of power translates into pure driving exhilaration.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Race-Inspired Engineering**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Rolling on staggered 20-inch front and 21-inch rear GT3 RS forged aluminum wheels wrapped in ultra-high-performance summer tires (275\\\/30ZR20 front, 335\\\/30ZR21 rear), this machine commands attention. The sport-tuned adaptive suspension with driver-selectable modes and 4-wheel vented disc brakes with ABS provide track-ready capability with everyday usability.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Striking Presence**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Finished in pristine White with a dramatic wing spoiler and body-colored aerodynamic elements, this GT3 RS makes an unmistakable statement. LED headlamps, rear fog lamps, and black-finished exhaust tips complete the aggressive aesthetic.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Driver-Focused Cockpit**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The Black interior with GT Silver stitching features Leather\\\/Race-Tex seat trim on full bucket seats, creating the perfect balance of luxury and motorsport functionality. The Race-Tex simulated suede steering wheel, headliner, and door trim inserts immerse you in racing heritage, while carbon fiber and metal-look accents elevate the cabin's sophistication.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Premium Technology**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Stay connected with Porsche Communication Management featuring wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto, navigation with real-time traffic, and the Bose Surround Sound System. The Track Precision app lets you analyze your performance, while the central tachometer in White keeps your focus where it belongs.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Thoughtful Enhancements**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The extended 23.7-gallon fuel tank extends your driving adventures, while personalized floor mats with leather edging add a bespoke touch. Dual-zone climate control, proximity key entry, and a backup camera provide modern convenience.<br\\\/><br\\\/>This is more than transportation&mdash;it's a statement of passion. Visit Prestige Imports today to claim this exceptional 2023 Porsche 911 GT3 RS. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":18,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\"