ive aerodynamic elements, aggressive front splitter, wide fenders, center-lock wheels, and an unmistakable motorsport-inspired stance. Inside, the driver-focused cockpit combines lightweight construction, premium materials, and performance-oriented details that keep the emphasis firmly on the driving experience. Designed for enthusiasts who demand an even greater connection between road car and race car, this GT3 RS with Manthey Racing upgrades represents an extraordinary expression of Porsche engineering and track-focused performance. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Porsche 911 GT3 RS yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":18,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2025-porsche-911-gt3-rs-manthey-racing-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66172938\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2025-Porsche-911-GT3-RS-Manthey-Racing-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AF2A90SS279534\\\/sz_117804\\\/090ca710a81e2a2b3aa4904eec4e4f39.jpg\",\"photoCount\":58,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,USB Port\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnersta