"7\",\"engineCylindersNumber\":\"6\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"4.0\",\"engineDescription\":\"4L H-6 gasoline direct injection, DOHC, VarioCam variable valve control, premium unleaded, engine with 502HP\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"Black w\\\/GT Silver Stitch\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"Race-Tex simulated suede and leather front se\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Gentian Blue Metallic\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"172356\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"96.7\",\"vehicleId\":145465553,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":275,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2025-12-29 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"ABOUT THIS VEHICLE Prestige Imports is proud to offer this 2022 Porsche 911 GT3 Touring for sale! Own a piece of driving legend with this 2022 Porsche 911 GT3 Touring, a masterfully engineered sports car that blends race-bred performance with understated elegance. Powered by a high-revving 4.0-liter naturally aspirated flat-6 and paired with Porsches engaging 6-speed GT Sport manual transmission featuring auto-blip downshifts, this GT3 Touring delivers pure, unfiltered connection between driver and machine. With iconic GT3 chassis dynamics, rear-axle steering, track-capable brakes, and a touring-focused retractable spoiler, its equally at home carving canyon roads or smoking laps at your favorite circuit, all while dressed in a more refined, timeless aesthetic than its fixed-wing counterpart. Built for the enthusiast who demands both performance and purity, this 911 GT3 Touring is a rare opportunity to own one of the most coveted manual supercars of the modern era. Contact Prestige Imports to make this beautiful Porsche 911 GT3 Touring yours today. All pricing and details provided are believed to be accurate, but we do not warrant or guarantee such accuracy. The prices shown above may vary from region to region, as will incentives, and are subject to change. New vehicles offered may be eligible for manufacturer incentives which may change at any time and are subject to incentive qualification criteria and requirements, and which may be contingent upon manufacturer finance company approval. Manufacturer incentive data and vehicle features information is provided by third parties and believed to be accurate as of the time of publication. Vehicle information is based upon standard equipment and may vary from vehicle to vehicle. Please contact the dealership.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"Coupe\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"Coupe\",\"epaHighway\":18,\"epaCity\":15,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2022-porsche-911-gt3-w\\\/-touring-package-north-miami-beach-fl-id-64609354\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2022-Porsche-911-GT3-w-Touring-Package-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AC2A94NS269151\\\/sz_41628\\\/7b334f30f8c597c62e257acda7808ec9.jpg\",\"photoCount\":48,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Android Auto,Apple CarPlay,Automatic Emergency Braking,Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Dual Climate Control,Heated Seats,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Power Driver Seat,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,USB Port,WIFI Hotspot\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\