ndersNumber\":\"6\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"4.0\",\"engineDescription\":\"\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"Black\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"252627\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Black\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"252627\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147215606,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":55,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-08-06 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"Prestige Imports is delighted to offer this 2026 Porsche 911 GT3 Touring for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Designed for enthusiasts who appreciate the ultimate combination of motorsport engineering and understated elegance, the GT3 Touring delivers the extraordinary performance of a GT3 with a more refined, road-focused appearance. Powered by a naturally aspirated 4.0L flat-six producing 502 horsepower and 331 lb-ft of torque, the GT3 Touring revs to an incredible 9,000 rpm and sends its power to the rear wheels through a six-speed manual transmission, creating an exceptionally engaging connection between driver and machine. Its signature Touring Package replaces the fixed rear wing with a seamlessly integrated adaptive rear spoiler, allowing the sculpted 911 silhouette to remain clean and timeless while still delivering the aerodynamic performance expected from a GT3. Inside, the driver-focused cabin combines premium leather and Race-Tex appointments with GT-specific details and modern Porsche technology, creating an environment equally suited to spirited weekend drives and everyday touring. With motorsport-derived suspension, rear-axle steering, lightweight engineering, and one of Porsche's most celebrated naturally aspirated engines, the 911 GT3 Touring is a modern driver's car that rewards precision and passion in equal measure. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Porsche 911 GT3 Touring yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":null,\"epaCity\":null,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2026-porsche-911-gt3-w\\\/-touring-package-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65800500\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2026-Porsche-911-GT3-w-Touring-Package-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AC2A94TS289364\\\/sz_98552\\\/23a85e7a992f94395a67fd7f71460532.jpg\",\"photoCount\":49,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Heated Seats,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Premium Sound System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/1own.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/GQNnM4gwiFLWlowO1uKugOCLvjFJPfxdpPJ5esbTn9atf2qzJu2Ct3pUcz-_rzSSY-5yq0yOB5qVPAZ5ariqul9pDQKKwtdhyVw\",\"isOneOwner\":true},\"isInTransit\":0,\"certifiedInspectionUrl\":null,\"standardizedExteriorColor\":\"Black\",\"standardizedBody\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedDrivetrain\":\"Rear-Wheel Drive\",\"standardizedEngineDisplacement\":\"4.0\",\"standardizedEngineCylinders\":\"6 Cylinder\",\"standardizedTransmission\":\"Automatic\",\"standardizedFuelType\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"standardizedInteriorColor\":\"Black\",\"standardizedInteriorUpholstery\":\"Unspecified\\\/Other\",\"upperLevelPackageCode\":null,\"packagesAndAccessories\":[],\"certificationProgram\":\"\",\"title\":\"2026 Porsche 911 GT3 w\\\/ Touring Package\",\"status\":\"in stock\",\"rebateAmount\":0,\"isReserved\":0,\"isCourtesy\":0,\"statusCode\":null,\"disclaimers\":[],\"isPooled\":0,\"cpo_validated\":null,\"vdp\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.lamborghinimiami.com\\\/vehicle-details\\\/used-2026-porsche-911-gt3-w\\\/-touring-package-north-miami-beach-fl-id-65800500\",\"srp\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.lamborghinimiami.com\\\/used-2026-porsche-911-miami-fl\"}); });<\/script>\n<script>window.inlineJS.push(function() { Moff.modules.get('DataLayer').pushData('VehicleObject_66013484', {\"vuid\":66013484,\"stockNumber\":\"10858D\",\"year\":2026,\"isNew\":false,\"finalPrice\":351697,\"make\":\"Porsche\",\"model\":\"911\",\"modelNumber\":\"\",\"modelCode\":71402,\"trim\":\"GT3 w\\\/Touring Package\",\"styleDescription\":\"\",\"styleId\":475900,\"doorsNumber\":\"2\",\"vin\":\"WP0AC2A95TS287476\",\"MSRP\":0,\"invoiceAmount\":0,\"blueBook\":0,\"sellingPrice\":349950,\"internetPrice\":0,\"originalPrice\":349950,\"miscPrice1\":0,\"miscPrice2\":0,\"miscPrice3\":0,\"NADARetailPrice\":0,\"mileage\":1072,\"transmission\":\"manual\",\"transmissionDescription\":\"\",\"transmissionSpeedNumber\":\"\",\"engineCylindersNumber\":\"6\",\"engineDisplacement\":\"4.0\",\"engineDescription\":\"\",\"engineAspirationType\":\"\",\"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Ice Grey Metallic\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"F2F6F9\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147528749,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":44,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-08-17 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"**Prestige Imports Presents: 2026 Porsche 911 GT3 Touring**<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Stock #AT287476 \\\/ VIN: WP0AC2A95TS287476**<br\\\/><br\\\/>For the purist who demands uncompromising performance without the flash, this virtually new 2026 Porsche 911 GT3 Touring represents the pinnacle of driver-focused engineering. With a mere 1,070 miles on the odometer, this CARFAX and AUTOCHECK Clean One Owner example is essentially brand new, offering you the opportunity to own one of the most coveted sports cars ever created at a fraction of the original investment.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**The Heart of a Champion**<br\\\/><br\\\/>At its core lies the legendary 4.0-liter naturally aspirated flat-six boxer engine, a masterpiece that revs to 9,000 RPM and delivers an intoxicating symphony that no turbocharged engine can replicate. Paired with the purist's choice&mdash;a 6-speed GT Sport manual transmission&mdash;this GT3 Touring offers an unfiltered connection between driver and machine that's increasingly rare in today's automotive landscape.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Performance Without Compromise**<br\\\/><br\\\/>The GT3 Touring's rear-wheel-drive configuration, mechanical limited slip differential, and driver-selectable sport-tuned adaptive suspension deliver track-ready performance that remains civilized for daily driving. Massive 4-wheel vented disc brakes with ABS and brake assist provide fade-free stopping power, while the staggered 20-inch front and 21-inch rear wheels wrapped in performance rubber ensure maximum grip.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Understated Elegance**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Unlike its winged GT3 sibling, the Touring variant features a sleek power spoiler that maintains the classic 911 silhouette while still providing aerodynamic efficiency. LED headlamps, body-colored bumpers, and polished dual exhaust tips complete the sophisticated appearance.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Technology Meets Tradition**<br\\\/><br\\\/>Inside, you'll find heated 4-way Sport Seats Plus that provide exceptional support during spirited driving. The Porsche Communication Management system features navigation, wireless smartphone charging, voice control, and 10 years of Porsche Connect services. The Sound Package Plus with 8 speakers delivers impressive audio quality, while dual-zone automatic climate control ensures comfort in any condition.<br\\\/><br\\\/>**Peace of Mind**<br\\\/><br\\\/>This GT3 Touring comes equipped with advanced safety features including dual-stage airbags, stability control, collision mitigation, backup camera, and Porsche Vehicle Tracking System.<br\\\/><br\\\/>Don't miss this rare opportunity to own an essentially new GT3 Touring&mdash;the thinking enthusiast's supercar. Contact Prestige Imports today to experience automotive perfection. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":null,\"epaCity\":null,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2026-porsche-911-gt3-w\\\/touring-package-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66013484\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2026-Porsche-911-GT3-w-Touring-Package-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AC2A95TS287476\\\/sz_103431\\\/e4dd9f45c246c8019d7d0ca0943ec6e4.jpg\",\"photoCount\":45,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Heated Seats,Keyle