nology, creating an environment centered around the connection between driver and machine. For enthusiasts who value the involvement of a manual transmission, the character of a naturally aspirated flat-six, and the timeless design of the 911, the GT3 Touring represents one of Porsches most rewarding modern sports cars. <br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Porsche 911 GT3 Touring yours today. Sales Price includes dealer fee of $1447.50 and $299 electronic filing fee. Tax, tag, title and registrations fees are not included and are calculated at time of purchase.\",\"isOEMCertified\":0,\"isDealerCertified\":0,\"body\":\"\",\"standardBody\":null,\"bodyStyle\":\"\",\"epaHighway\":19,\"epaCity\":14,\"drivetrain\":\"Rear Wheel Drive\",\"hasWarranty\":0,\"isSold\":0,\"dealerId\":7006,\"dealerCity\":\"North Miami Beach\",\"dealerState\":\"FL\",\"location\":\"North Miami Beach, FL\",\"dealerName\":\"Lamborghini Miami\",\"seoUrl\":\"vehicle-details\\\/used-2024-porsche-911-gt3-w\\\/touring-package-north-miami-beach-fl-id-66080933\",\"mainImageUrl\":\"\\\/\\\/cdn-ds.com\\\/stock\\\/2024-Porsche-911-GT3-w-Touring-Package-North-Miami-Beach-FL\\\/seo\\\/ICC80512-WP0AC2A95RS263509\\\/sz_103223\\\/c9f39f78dd8663833dc6868bea9cd11b.jpg\",\"photoCount\":43,\"series\":\"\",\"xSeries\":\"\",\"seriesCode\":\"\",\"cab\":\"\",\"bed\":\"\",\"videoCount\":0,\"comment1\":\"Backup Camera,Brake Assist,Heated Seats,Keyless Entry,Keyless Start,Leather Seats,Limited Slip Center Differential,Navigation System,Premium Sound System,Rear Spoiler,Stability Control,Traction Control,USB Port\",\"comment2\":\"\",\"comment3\":\"\",\"comment4\":\"\",\"comment5\":\"\",\"otherInfo\":{\"isVinDecodeEnabled\":true},\"dealerComment\":\"\",\"videos\":[],\"images\":{},\"viewCount\":0,\"carfaxReport\":{\"image\":\"https:\\\/\\\/partnerstatic.carfax.com\\\/img\\\/valuebadge\\\/fair.svg\",\"link\":\"https:\\\/\\\/www.carfax.com\\\/vehiclehistory\\\/ar20\\\/eAlCHf-JBVfAqvbCf7r5SZV7LGF9c7VhXBbzohoaa4SPs