olor\":\"Basalt Black\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"Race-Tex simulated suede and leather front se\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Chalk\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"808080\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"96.5\",\"vehicleId\":146116860,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":140,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-05-13 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"Prestige Imports is delighted to offer this 2025 Porsche 911 Targa 4 GTS for sale!<br\\\/><br\\\/>The Porsche 911 Targa 4 GTS delivers the perfect blend of open-air freedom, everyday refinement, and exhilarating performance, continuing the legacy of one of Porsches most iconic models. Powered by a twin-turbocharged 3.6L flat-six hybrid powertrain producing 532 horsepower, the Targa 4 GTS accelerates from 0&ndash;60 mph in just over 3 seconds while benefiting from Porsches legendary all-wheel-drive system and razor-sharp handling. Its unmistakable Targa roof design, wide rear stance, and timeless 911 silhouette create a presence that is elegant from every angle. Built for enthusiasts who appreciate the thrill of open-air motoring without sacrificing year-round usability, the Targa 4 GTS offers a driving experience that feels equally at home on coastal highways, winding mountain roads, or downtown city streets. Whether enjoying a sunset drive with the roof retracted or carving through back roads with confidence, the 911 Targa 4 GTS delivers a level of versatility and excitement that few sports cars can match.<br\\\/><br\\\/>Contact Prestige Imports to make this Targa 4 GTS yours today. All pricing and details provided are believed to be accurate, but we do not warrant or guarantee such accuracy. The prices shown above may vary from region to region, as will incentives, and are subject to