"engineBlockType\":\"\",\"interiorColor\":\"Black\",\"interiorColorCode\":\"252627\",\"interiorColorHex\":null,\"interiorColorIcon\":null,\"upholstery\":\"\",\"interiorColorGeneric\":null,\"exteriorColor\":\"Jet Black Metallic\",\"exteriorColorCode\":\"252627\",\"exteriorColorHex\":null,\"exteriorColorIcon\":null,\"exteriorColorGeneric\":null,\"fuelType\":\"\",\"wheelbaseCode\":\"\",\"vehicleId\":147089141,\"isSpecial\":0,\"specialDisclaimer\":\"\",\"daysInStock\":64,\"dateInStock\":{\"date\":\"2026-07-28 00:00:00.000000\",\"timezone_type\":3,\"timezone\":\"UTC\"},\"description\":\"Prestige Imports is delighted to offer this 2015 Porsche 911 Targa 4S for sale! <br\\\/><br\\\/>Combining the timeless character of the 911 with the unique open-air experience of Porsche's legendary Targa design, the Targa 4S delivers an exceptional blend of performance, luxury, and everyday usability. Powered by a naturally aspirated 3.8L flat-six producing 400 horsepower and 325 lb-ft of torque, the Targa 4S sends its power through Porsche Traction Management all-wheel drive and can accelerate from 0&ndash;60 mph in as little as 4.0 seconds when equipped with PDK and Sport Chrono. Its signature retractable Targa roof, brushed aluminum roll hoop, and wraparound rear glass create an unmistakable silhouette that pays homage to Porsche's heritage while offering the freedom of open-air driving. Inside, the beautifully appointed cabin combines premium leather, intuitive technology, supportive sport seats, and the driver-focused ergonomics that have defined the 911 for generations. Whether carving through winding roads with the roof open, cruising along the coast, or enjoying a spirited weekend drive, the Targa 4S offers a remarkable balance of refinement and performance. As one of Porsche's most distinctive modern 911 configurations, the 2015 Targa 4S represents an ideal choice for enthusiasts who want the excitement of a sports car with the versatility and character of a grand tourer. <br\\\